{
  "comment": "OneCalc milestone 4 acceptance (dc-0f1k, dc-snz.2): every set is loaded through the OneCalc page (`cargo xtask app xll-accept onecalc`) and its cases are compared with Excel's answers from an untraced run of run.ps1 in an owned hidden session (the `excel` record). Variables: {fixture} this folder, {build} ../build, {x1} the own X1 add-in, {x3} the xlw and xlOil runtime folders, {cvba} the generated add-in, {excel} the folder of Excel controller records, {m4} the staged artifacts.",
